WEBVTT

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:13.280
Kanako!

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:15.360
Angela!

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:16.860
Did you get lost?

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:21.000
Hey, it's my third time to 
visit Japan. No worries.

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:28.330
How is Sue? She's joined Genshiken, right?

00:00:29.430 --> 00:00:32.090
Yeah. She's getting quite used to it.

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:36.050
Okay, then let's go to the club room.
 Is everybody there?

00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:38.860
Well...

00:02:10.750 --> 00:02:14.400
It's just before summer Comic Festival,

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:18.820
and Genshiken is working on the last 
52 pages of Ogiue's pro project.

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:21.580
They're working very hard.

00:02:26.020 --> 00:02:27.640
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:31.540
This is all because I wrote fifty
pages for the Comic Festival manga.

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:33.780
No, no. It's fun!

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:36.340
If you give up, the game is already over!

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:39.180
This is perfect for getting
fired up for Comic Festival!

00:02:39.180 --> 00:02:41.760
Since we're being paid, we're pros too!

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:43.230
Nice Boat! {this is a reference to a School Days meme, and needs to be improperly capitalized}

00:02:43.230 --> 00:02:45.470
Yeah! Nice Boat!

00:02:45.880 --> 00:02:50.270
How many times have we heard that? 
They've stayed up so many nights they're going crazy.

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:54.690
And this is next month's issue with part one in it! 
Seeing this makes my tiredness fly away!

00:02:54.690 --> 00:02:57.650
I'm too embarrassed to look at it much.

00:02:57.650 --> 00:02:59.980
I put the tone on this!

00:02:59.980 --> 00:03:02.850
So did I. And I've heard 
that a hundred times now.

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:05.920
Most of it was Hato-chan's 
backgrounds though.

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:07.460
Hato-chan?

00:03:08.440 --> 00:03:10.130
What's wrong?

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:14.460
Sempai... this is an emergency.

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:15.840
Are you sick?

00:03:17.190 --> 00:03:19.120
I think...

00:03:19.890 --> 00:03:22.210
I'm starting to grow a beard.

00:03:23.490 --> 00:03:25.430
Beards and Boobs!

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:32.730
And having something growing 
when I'm dressed like this...

00:03:32.730 --> 00:03:36.040
...is just so embarrassing!

00:03:36.640 --> 00:03:38.550
By "something" she means a beard, right?

00:03:38.550 --> 00:03:40.500
What else could she mean?

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:42.030
Dick-dock.

00:03:42.390 --> 00:03:44.670
Hato. Turn this around.

00:03:44.670 --> 00:03:45.700
Yajima-san?

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:48.790
Your beard is embarrasing because 
you're dressed like a girl.

00:03:49.060 --> 00:03:52.140
Then you'll be fine if you go 
back to dressing like a guy!

00:03:52.140 --> 00:03:53.490
I see!

00:03:53.490 --> 00:03:57.680
That phrase you kept repeating like 
an idiot is finally coming in handy!

00:03:55.390 --> 00:03:57.790
I'm not a girl, so it's not embarrassing! {Reference to strike witches: they're not panties so it's not embarrassing.}

00:03:57.790 --> 00:04:00.920
Like an idiot? Is that what you thought?

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:04.550
Um.... you're right that that's one solution,

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:07.550
but I didn't bring any men's clothing.

00:04:07.970 --> 00:04:10.450
Why didn't you?

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:13.480
I knew these two were gonna clash.

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:16.290
It's summer vacation so I was 
able to come straight from home.

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:19.390
I haven't been to Madarame-sempai's 
room in a long time.

00:04:20.050 --> 00:04:24.970
Want to borrow some of mine?
I've got some that are big and kind of boyish.

00:04:24.970 --> 00:04:27.250
No, I couldn't.

00:04:29.320 --> 00:04:31.060
Do your job.

00:04:32.340 --> 00:04:33.790
Right.

00:04:35.850 --> 00:04:39.450
Sue-san's loyalty to her sempai is amazing.

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:42.030
She must love sempai's manga.

00:04:42.030 --> 00:04:45.000
Chika's panties are mine! And my-- {Doraemon reference, supposedly.}

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:45.640
That's enough!

00:04:45.640 --> 00:04:48.060
... panties are Chika's.

00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:52.880
Sue-san, I mean, Chief! I've got an idea!

00:04:54.760 --> 00:04:59.560
Ohno-sempai begged us to let her leave 
these cosplay outfits here, right?

00:04:59.560 --> 00:05:01.170
They're totally in the way.

00:05:01.170 --> 00:05:06.700
If there's a male character costume
in the box, Hato-chan can wear that.

00:05:06.810 --> 00:05:08.500
Cosplay?

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:10.550
That might work.

00:05:11.100 --> 00:05:14.440
I'm sorry, I just...

00:05:14.440 --> 00:05:18.370
I can't accept having a beard 
when I'm dressed like this.

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:20.940
It may be easier to just cosplay,

00:05:20.940 --> 00:05:25.420
and show you what I look like 
as a guy like Yajima-san says.

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:30.050
No, wait. It's not that I 
want to see you as a guy.

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:33.100
You guys have all gone nuts.

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:34.700
Then it's settled.

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:41.140
Are these all costumes for
trap characters, Ohno-sempai?

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:43.950
Of course they are.
 Now let's get back to work.

00:05:43.950 --> 00:05:45.820
Susie's gonna get mad.

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:47.340
Yajimacchi.

00:05:47.890 --> 00:05:51.200
That outfit is a size LL, right?

00:05:54.730 --> 00:05:57.340
Sempai, can I borrow your makeup remover?

00:05:57.340 --> 00:06:01.290
It's nothing great, it comes 
with a face wash, but okay.

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:02.800
That's fine.

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:04.600
Why?

00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:07.090
Now now. I'm cosplaying too.

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:10.650
That's not cosplay! That's just a sweatsuit!

00:06:10.650 --> 00:06:14.500
No. It's kind of a shock how well it works.

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:18.790
Especially the fact that 
I can wear my own glasses!

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:23.190
This isn't fair! Why my clothes?

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:27.310
I haven't even taken a bath yet! 
Do you know how much a fat girl can sweat?

00:06:27.310 --> 00:06:30.940
Well, I'm really thin,
 and I'm still sweating like a pig.

00:06:30.940 --> 00:06:32.740
You shut up!

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:34.890
We all stink!

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:38.580
Why is all this happening? Is it my fault?

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:39.840
Keep working.

00:06:39.840 --> 00:06:40.930
Right, chief.

00:06:40.930 --> 00:06:42.740
I'm back.

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:46.340
I'll get back to work right away.

00:06:51.090 --> 00:06:52.800
So where's the beard?

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:54.050
Right here.

00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:56.410
I can't even see it!

00:06:56.410 --> 00:06:59.590
No, you can. It's almost there.

00:06:59.590 --> 00:07:01.850
He's not as polite when he's a girl.

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:05.700
I've got more armpit hair than that.

00:07:05.700 --> 00:07:07.320
You're not working.

00:07:07.540 --> 00:07:11.780
Um... thanks, Yajima-san,
 for lending me your clothes.

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:14.740
It's fine. Just get to work.

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:16.700
Yeah, I'll hurry.

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:21.270
When I finish, I'll put on my mascara and 
old clothes, and I can wash these.

00:07:21.270 --> 00:07:24.420
Huh? Maybe I can't return them washed?

00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:29.210
Yeah. Yajimacchi can't 
leave dressed like that.

00:07:31.480 --> 00:07:34.460
It doesn't matter. She can put them back on.

00:07:35.230 --> 00:07:37.810
Of course it does!

00:07:38.220 --> 00:07:40.050
Take them off! Take them off right now!

00:07:40.050 --> 00:07:42.070
I'm not lending them to you 
after all! Take them off!

00:07:42.070 --> 00:07:44.350
Wait! I'm still in girl's underwear!

00:07:44.350 --> 00:07:45.690
Wear this!

00:07:48.640 --> 00:07:53.780
Even if you're a trap, if you're a 
guy you're allowed to have a beard!

00:07:55.630 --> 00:07:57.250
Hato-kun?

00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:04.370
I'm alright. I'm sorry for the trouble.

00:08:12.180 --> 00:08:14.740
I'd like the school building 
drawn at a low angle.

00:08:14.740 --> 00:08:15.220
Right.

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:18.910
Sue-san. Why don't you cosplay too,

00:08:18.910 --> 00:08:21.520
so all the freshmen are doing it?

00:08:21.670 --> 00:08:26.390
I thought so. But when I 
looked in the box, Sue-san...

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:35.030
Sue?

00:08:43.780 --> 00:08:47.630
Um, why don't you try it too?

00:08:54.270 --> 00:08:58.160
Well, it's my fault 
this happened anyway.

00:09:02.160 --> 00:09:03.390
Angela, maybe.

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:06.730
Oh, that's right. 
She's already here, isn't she?

00:09:06.730 --> 00:09:10.570
Well, I guess it's okay if it's 
just Angela and Ohno-sempai.

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:21.150
Do you think this is a joke?

00:09:21.150 --> 00:09:25.060
Are you stupid? Why are 
you dressed like that?

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:29.860
Yabusaki had come to bring us snacks.
She yelled at us for a whole hour.

00:09:29.860 --> 00:09:35.450
But after that she helped us,
and we made the deadline somehow.

00:09:38.770 --> 00:09:44.360
Yagurabashi is currently off-limits!

00:09:45.030 --> 00:09:47.320
Comic Festival has begun!

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:55.990
Hato-kun, I know it's a little 
late for me to be saying this,

00:09:55.990 --> 00:09:58.240
but you're fine with cosplaying, right?

00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:01.000
I have to be.

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:05.470
You said it would cause a lot of problems 
if I dressed my usual way out here.

00:10:05.470 --> 00:10:08.550
I'm trying to look as 
much like a guy as I can.

00:10:08.550 --> 00:10:12.240
I don't think you made it.
 You look like a girl to me.

00:10:12.240 --> 00:10:15.840
You should dress like a guy. 
We saw you do it last time.

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:20.720
That was a mistake made after too many 
sleepless nights! Please forget about it!

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:25.180
Anyway, I decided that when we went around 
the women's circles, I'd go as a girl.

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:28.230
Well, it seems important to her, 
so let's respect her decision.

00:10:28.230 --> 00:10:33.280
But just so we're clear,
 please make sure you use the men's restroom.

00:10:33.280 --> 00:10:34.610
Right.

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:38.070
You really are a boy. <i>Ooh.</i>

00:10:38.080 --> 00:10:40.320
Why you did that now?

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:43.050
Sorry. Just a typical joke.

00:10:43.050 --> 00:10:45.420
I'm happy... yet frustrated!

00:10:45.420 --> 00:10:47.290
Well done!

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:49.890
You're cosplaying today too,
 aren't you, Angela-san?

00:10:49.890 --> 00:10:53.710
Cosplay? Yeah, I have left shopping to Sue.

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:57.970
Well, I should say, I read books selected by her.
 Her choice is surely good.

00:10:57.970 --> 00:11:00.160
The books are here.

00:11:00.180 --> 00:11:02.520
Ogiue-sempai isn't here yet, is she?

00:11:02.520 --> 00:11:07.480
She'll show. She's got our 
registration card and the samples.

00:11:07.480 --> 00:11:09.550
We can't sell anything without them.

00:11:09.550 --> 00:11:11.440
Let's get it set up.

00:11:13.300 --> 00:11:14.980
What are you doing here?

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:16.520
Yah.

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:21.610
She was up all night working 
on the copy book and collapsed?

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:25.230
Wait a second. The pro book 
was due yesterday, right?

00:11:25.230 --> 00:11:27.540
She stayed up all night drawing after that?

00:11:27.990 --> 00:11:31.940
That idiot... I hope she doesn't get sick.

00:11:32.590 --> 00:11:34.120
What's that?

00:11:37.670 --> 00:11:40.830
Show me that, damn it!
 I mean, please show it to me.

00:11:40.830 --> 00:11:44.260
Nobody's gonna stop you. Nyah.

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:48.850
Start lining up. Everybody please stand!

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:53.050
Please get as close as possible 
to the person in front of you.

00:11:53.050 --> 00:11:55.960
Jeez... finally.

00:11:56.110 --> 00:11:58.150
It's finally time!

00:12:00.630 --> 00:12:04.990
We will now begin the first 
day of Comic Festival.

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:08.580
Be quiet. I told you to sit down.

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:10.750
Nyah-ko, sit down.

00:12:13.110 --> 00:12:15.870
And now it's started, nyah.

00:12:15.870 --> 00:12:17.340
Seriously?

00:12:17.340 --> 00:12:19.340
Applause!

00:12:24.630 --> 00:12:29.650
I'll sit down, though. No point in 
fighting over something like this.

00:12:29.880 --> 00:12:31.610
I'll take your new volume.

00:12:32.740 --> 00:12:35.160
Um... these are our new volumes.

00:12:35.160 --> 00:12:38.210
Right after we started? That soon?

00:12:38.350 --> 00:12:40.650
Are you the author? Ogino-sensei?

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:44.850
No, I'm not. She collapsed after staying up 
all night and will be here in the evening.

00:12:44.850 --> 00:12:49.720
I read <i>Afternoon</i>. Tell her I'm 
looking forward to part two.

00:12:49.930 --> 00:12:50.800
Right.

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:52.370
Thank you!

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:57.280
Ogiue's part one wasn't that 
well-received online.

00:12:57.420 --> 00:12:58.880
Quite the opposite.

00:12:58.880 --> 00:13:04.220
I guess not everybody agreed with that, nyah.

00:13:04.320 --> 00:13:07.870
That idiot. She needs to be here!

00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:09.100
I'll take the new book.

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:10.330
I'll take part one.

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:11.490
Can I buy this?

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:12.610
May I see this?

00:13:12.610 --> 00:13:13.840
Oh no.

00:13:13.840 --> 00:13:18.160
It totally looks like we're 
trying to profit off her!

00:13:18.160 --> 00:13:19.950
You just realized?

00:13:19.950 --> 00:13:22.950
I just wanted to work with her!

00:13:22.950 --> 00:13:25.760
Tell that to her! Nyah.

00:13:27.090 --> 00:13:28.950
I'm back.

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:30.090
Oh my.

00:13:30.090 --> 00:13:32.340
That's not a trap cosplay.

00:13:32.340 --> 00:13:36.150
There was a limited edition drama CD where 
this character comes to Comic Festival.

00:13:36.150 --> 00:13:37.420
As a rotten girl.

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:38.620
Seriously?

00:13:38.620 --> 00:13:41.750
Nobody remembers anymore, I think.

00:13:43.590 --> 00:13:46.660
I don't think I stand out too much like this.

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:51.780
But crossdressing and cosplay 
really are different!

00:13:51.780 --> 00:13:54.610
When you cosplay, you're 
expecting to be seen.

00:13:54.840 --> 00:13:58.270
Even so, it's much better 
than everyone thinking I'm a guy.

00:13:58.270 --> 00:14:00.460
Okay, you start with 
Flower/Scales, Hato-chan. {Possibly a reference to an obscure yuri manga? http://www.amazon.co.jp/%E5%A4%A9%E7%A7%A4%E3%81%AF%E8%8A%B1%E3%81%A8%E9%81%8A%E3%81%B6-1-%E3%81%BE%E3%82%93%E3%81%8C%E3%82%BF%E3%82%A4%E3%83%A0KR%E3%82%B3%E3%83%9F%E3%83%83%E3%82%AF%E3%82%B9-%E5%8D%AF%E8%8A%B1-%E3%81%A4%E3%81%8B%E3%81%95/dp/4832277979}

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:04.810
Start there and get us five copies each of 
every new volume from the circles I marked.

00:14:04.810 --> 00:14:05.690
Okay!

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:11.110
When you've got them all, or you can't carry 
anymore, go to Ogi-sempai's "Snow Retreat."

00:14:11.170 --> 00:14:14.370
Expect a long line for the 
biggest women's manga.

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:18.420
Okay, Yajimacchi and I will 
hit the lines on the outside.

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:19.030
Yeah!

00:14:19.030 --> 00:14:20.250
Good luck!

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:24.210
<b>East A-22ab
 Flower/Scales
 End of line</b>

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:26.630
Um... this is the place right?

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:31.980
I see. So the last person holds the placard.

00:14:31.980 --> 00:14:33.260
I'll take that.

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:36.680
I'll take that.

00:14:36.680 --> 00:14:39.650
Wow. It keeps getting longer.

00:14:40.030 --> 00:14:42.860
And they're all like me, right?

00:14:42.860 --> 00:14:45.320
Okay, five books will be 3500 yen.

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:47.680
All right! Nobody found me out!

00:14:48.630 --> 00:14:51.650
Okay! I'll buy a lot!

00:14:52.630 --> 00:14:56.670
Looks like the first rush is over. 
We sold out of the copy books.

00:14:56.670 --> 00:14:59.050
I'm going to go buy some things, nyah!

00:14:59.050 --> 00:14:59.880
Wait!

00:14:59.880 --> 00:15:03.040
Two is plenty, and there's not room to sit.

00:15:03.040 --> 00:15:04.340
Bye!

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:24.440
<b>Men's Toilet</b>

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:30.820
<b>Men's Toilet
 End of Line #2</b>

00:15:35.470 --> 00:15:38.420
No, I'm #1.

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:44.250
<b>Men's Toilet
 End of Line #2</b>

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:48.730
I hope the next person comes soon.

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:50.930
Thank you.

00:15:51.060 --> 00:15:54.930
Huh? Somebody other than Ogiue's 
got a manga this time.

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:56.860
Thank yo--

00:15:56.860 --> 00:15:58.930
Can I have five copies?

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:05.340
Sorry, that's us. 3500 yen.

00:16:05.340 --> 00:16:09.910
I see. So you two are Ogiue's 
partners right now, right?

00:16:09.910 --> 00:16:12.120
I don't know if "partner" 
is the right word for it.

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:13.860
Tell me if somebody's behind you.

00:16:13.860 --> 00:16:14.610
Okay.

00:16:14.610 --> 00:16:16.840
Ogiue Chika is my waifu!

00:16:16.840 --> 00:16:17.980
Ssh.

00:16:18.610 --> 00:16:20.880
I see. I'm sorry.

00:16:20.880 --> 00:16:24.790
I was her classmate in middle school.
 My name's Nakajima.

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:26.400
Yeah?

00:16:26.400 --> 00:16:30.220
I'm not, but she's in a circle 
with her called Genshiken.

00:16:30.220 --> 00:16:32.660
Ogiue's the president.

00:16:32.730 --> 00:16:36.680
The president of a circle? That's...

00:16:36.940 --> 00:16:38.320
... not like her at all!

00:16:38.320 --> 00:16:41.020
Right? Not at all!

00:16:41.310 --> 00:16:43.530
Anyway, that makes me feel relieved.

00:16:43.530 --> 00:16:46.270
I was worried that she'd...

00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:50.180
...try to kill herself over a guy again.

00:16:55.170 --> 00:17:00.060
Last year Ogiue was here 
with her boyfriend right?

00:17:00.060 --> 00:17:05.210
When she didn't show up at the last Comic Festival,
 I was afraid something had happened.

00:17:05.430 --> 00:17:06.960
Back in middle school,

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:10.960
she used her boyfriend 
Makita-kun in a BL book.

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:13.630
He ended up having to change 
schools, and then she...

00:17:13.860 --> 00:17:17.800
No, no, no. Nakajima-san, was it?

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:22.930
It's the perfect job for Ogiue, I think.

00:17:22.930 --> 00:17:27.600
I could understand if it was the old Ogiue.

00:17:28.950 --> 00:17:30.840
I know that too.

00:17:30.990 --> 00:17:35.320
And her boyfriend does too! But they're dating!
 And they're really happy!

00:17:36.690 --> 00:17:40.430
Looks like you didn't have to worry.

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:42.430
So it seems.

00:17:43.110 --> 00:17:47.950
How many years has it been? 
Six? That's a long time.

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:51.710
I think I'll go now.

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:55.320
Will you be back after Ogiue gets here?

00:17:55.320 --> 00:17:57.090
No, I won't.

00:17:57.090 --> 00:17:58.540
You sure?

00:17:58.540 --> 00:18:03.770
I'm sure you two understand that 
it's better if I don't meet her.

00:18:04.450 --> 00:18:07.950
I probably won't stop by at the 
next Comic Festival either.

00:18:07.950 --> 00:18:09.960
So don't worry.

00:18:17.950 --> 00:18:19.950
She didn't notice?

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:21.950
Looks so.

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:27.870
We're still selling books? That's great.

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:29.860
She didn't even notice!

00:18:29.860 --> 00:18:32.470
Wait, why is your face so red?

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:36.250
I'm running a 39°C fever...

00:18:36.250 --> 00:18:38.650
Hey, you know what we have to do, right?

00:18:38.650 --> 00:18:39.870
'Course!

00:18:39.870 --> 00:18:41.940
Don't say anything about that girl.

00:18:41.940 --> 00:18:43.710
'Course not!

00:18:43.710 --> 00:18:45.080
Okay.

00:18:45.690 --> 00:18:46.770
Take her.

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:48.400
Yes ma'am!

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:52.900
Leave the rest to me.

00:18:56.980 --> 00:18:58.980
Ogiue was right behind us.

00:18:58.980 --> 00:19:00.960
There's no need to talk to her.

00:19:00.960 --> 00:19:02.980
But now Makita-kun is...

00:19:02.980 --> 00:19:04.800
There's no need to tell her that!

00:19:04.800 --> 00:19:08.660
We don't need to make her life any better.

00:19:08.890 --> 00:19:11.670
Why are you such a bitch?

00:19:11.670 --> 00:19:16.040
It's nothing new, so you 
don't need to say anything.

00:19:19.870 --> 00:19:24.070
Isn't it amazing? Ogiue-san's books sold out!

00:19:24.070 --> 00:19:28.270
It was fun selling them! Wasn't it, guys?

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:28.960
Yeah.

00:19:28.960 --> 00:19:30.230
Yes!

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:34.110
Think we could get a hand here?

00:19:34.110 --> 00:19:37.290
Madarame-san and the others 
will be here on day three.

00:19:37.290 --> 00:19:39.020
Madarame!

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:44.260
He has really pretty fingers, you know?

00:19:45.790 --> 00:19:49.160
Is she talking about Madarame-sempai?

00:19:49.180 --> 00:19:53.460
Here's today's earnings, 
and some doujinshi I found.

00:19:53.530 --> 00:19:57.670
I'd like you to count it up,
 but I don't think you can right now.

00:19:58.120 --> 00:20:01.190
We can have Sue do it, or...

00:20:02.190 --> 00:20:04.010
... have him do it.

00:20:09.030 --> 00:20:10.380
Let's go, Sue.

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:15.360
Sue... Sue, thanks.  You can go now.

00:20:16.680 --> 00:20:20.320
I hope you and your boyfriend explode!

00:20:28.490 --> 00:20:30.570
I'm sorry, Sasahara-san.

00:20:30.570 --> 00:20:31.270
Hm?

00:20:31.270 --> 00:20:36.420
I thought if Sue saw me crying, she'd worry.

00:20:36.640 --> 00:20:37.870
Mm.

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:42.430
I made her help me with a private project 
that had nothing to do with Genshiken,

00:20:42.430 --> 00:20:47.050
and then I got too sick to come 
on the day we sold our doujinshi!

00:20:47.250 --> 00:20:48.300
Mm.

00:20:48.300 --> 00:20:52.350
I feel like I'm a failure as a president!

00:20:52.350 --> 00:20:53.230
I see.

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:55.480
And then maybe...

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:59.270
They might think I just wanted 
to go to Comic Festival today.

00:20:59.520 --> 00:21:01.230
Ehh...

00:21:02.730 --> 00:21:07.360
Want to come to my place?
 You worked hard today.

00:21:09.540 --> 00:21:14.490
Yabu... Sue loves Yabu!

00:21:14.490 --> 00:21:15.950
What?

00:21:16.810 --> 00:21:18.660
A fish with a human face!

00:21:18.660 --> 00:21:21.390
I hope my cold gets better, and then...

00:21:21.390 --> 00:21:24.780
Even if your fever goes down,
 you shouldn't go tomorrow or the day after.

00:21:24.780 --> 00:21:26.470
Really?

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:27.640
Yup.

00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:28.890
I shouldn't?

00:21:28.890 --> 00:21:30.050
You shouldn't.

00:23:10.030 --> 00:23:13.030
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:10.900 --> 00:23:14.030
The summer anime shows have already 
finished episode 4? Time flies.

00:23:14.030 --> 00:23:17.110
I'm sure everyone's talking about 
which shows they've dropped online.

00:23:17.110 --> 00:23:19.390
I always give a series three episodes!

00:23:19.390 --> 00:23:21.300
So you actually drop shows?
 That's nothing to be proud of.

00:23:21.300 --> 00:23:23.530
You always get mad when something 
gets popular after you drop it.

00:23:23.530 --> 00:23:25.200
That's when I say everybody 
else on the board is a shill!

00:23:25.200 --> 00:23:26.350
You're horrible!

00:23:26.350 --> 00:23:28.170
Viral marketing! Viral marketing!

00:23:28.170 --> 00:23:30.610
Any time something sells that I don't like,
 it's due to viral marketing!

00:23:30.610 --> 00:23:33.630
The anime I like should sell a lot,
 and the ones I don't shouldn't sell at all!

00:23:33.630 --> 00:23:34.640
I don't care!

00:23:34.860 --> 00:23:38.120
Next time on <i>Genshiken: Second Generation</i> 
Go Next!
